 61	// Global transfer stats for the downloads header + the dashboard speed widget.
 62	// Producers fill what their source exposes cheaply: the per-tab header reads
 63	// current speeds; the speed-stats card reads speeds + lifetime totals. Fields a
 64	// given producer can't supply are left at 0.
