27	 * enabled. Pass `instanceId` to target a specific instance (used by aggregated
28	 * dashboard cards that render one slot per instance); omit it to follow the
29	 * user's currently-selected instance for that kind (used by per-service tabs).
30	 *
31	 * The returned `instanceId` is also what callers should fold into TanStack
32	 * Query keys so two configured instances never collide in the query cache.
33	 */
