546	  }
547	  // Fail fast instead of hanging on a host that provably can't answer: a LAN
548	  // address off WiFi (#106/#185; slot-neutral, so a private address in the
549	  // Remote URL slot trips it too) or a VPN-only Remote URL with no VPN up
550	  // (#394).
